# Build-context excludes for BOTH images (migration + control-plane), which
# each build from the repo root. Neither COPYs any of these, and terraform/
# alone is ~240MB of provider binaries -- excluding them shrinks the
# `az acr build` context upload from ~250MB to a few MB, and stops unrelated
# edits (e.g. a local `terraform init`) from busting the Docker layer cache.
#
# NB: Docker does NOT read .gitignore, so this file is required separately.

# VCS + CI + editor/agent config
.git
.github
.claude
.devcontainer

# Large + irrelevant to any image
terraform
notes
context
scripts
agent-workflow-steps

# Tests + Python caches (never needed at runtime)
tests
control-plane/api/tests
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.coverage

# Docs
README.md
CLAUDE.md
